# The released evidence package is content-addressed: artifacts/paper/manifest.json
# records a SHA-256 per file, so a checkout must reproduce those bytes exactly on
# every platform. Disable end-of-line conversion for the whole package.
artifacts/paper/** -text

# Binary assets: never touched by end-of-line conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary

# Windows batch files need CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
